# Don't ignore src directory - format everything in src
!src/**

# Generated by auto-changelog from commit bodies, and formatting it is actively
# harmful rather than merely pointless: prettier reads the underscores in prose
# like `DESIGN_PRINCIPLES ... corrects _to_` as markdown emphasis spanning two
# lines and rewrites them, turning that into `DESIGN*PRINCIPLES ... corrects
# \_to*`. It is not even idempotent -- a second run keeps editing. The release
# job regenerates this file wholesale, so nothing here is hand-written for
# prettier to tidy.
docs/CHANGELOG.md

# Generated by scripts/migrate/legacy-palette.ts and committed so the build
# does not need repository history. Formatting it would make it differ from
# what the generator emits, and scripts/codemod/legacy-palette-drift.test.ts
# compares the two byte for byte to catch drift -- prettier owning this file
# would make that check fail permanently and for the wrong reason.
scripts/codemod/assets/
